WEBVTT

00:23.060 --> 00:27.044
Driving north on 81, the autumn leaves are

00:27.104 --> 00:32.070
golden red My family is all around me, trying to

00:32.110 --> 00:37.368
clear my head We're headed for the parkway, just

00:37.388 --> 00:41.589
a perfect normal day Then we hit the sign at

00:41.749 --> 00:45.710
Lexington, the gauntlet's underway The ghost

00:45.930 --> 00:50.891
is in the car again, the ghost is in the lane Two

00:50.971 --> 00:55.392
blue shields side by side, her voice is in my

00:55.492 --> 01:01.394
brain I-64 the eastbound sign and 81 the north, I

01:01.434 --> 01:03.134
know the exits follow

01:07.876 --> 01:12.358
This is the 30 mile gauntlet I'm holding on so

01:12.378 --> 01:17.580
tight I'm trying to be normal I'm trying to win

01:17.681 --> 01:22.363
the fight But every sign is like a cut A reminder

01:22.463 --> 01:28.565
of a trap I'm just a passenger Caught in the ring,

01:28.605 --> 01:29.286
green map

01:35.762 --> 01:39.683
We're getting close to Stanton now The split is

01:39.783 --> 01:46.745
coming fast Exit 221, a test I have to pass Mark

01:46.785 --> 01:52.307
just asked me, are you ready? I look him in the eye

01:52.327 --> 01:57.529
I have to face this demon I'm ready, I will try

01:57.589 --> 02:01.411
We're on the ramp, the turn is made It's time for

02:01.471 --> 02:05.033
Richmond East The world just stops, the light

02:05.073 --> 02:09.397
just fades The monster is unleashed It's her

02:09.437 --> 02:14.060
road, it's her prison It's the place I cannot be

02:14.360 --> 02:19.184
Get me off, get me off She's coming, she's got me

02:43.248 --> 02:48.092
System crash I64

02:50.294 --> 02:59.221
That is not my name System crash She's at the door

03:01.763 --> 03:07.308
She's won the game I can't breathe, I can't see

03:07.368 --> 03:16.353
Get me out, get me free No, no, no, no

03:27.999 --> 03:28.420
Exit 91

